    "body": "## Problem\r\n\r\n`fnamemodify(path, ':p')` falls back to the shell for an unknown `~user`.\r\nFrom a fast event this re-enters the event loop and aborts Nvim.\r\n\r\nFixes #40707.\r\n\r\n## Solution\r\n\r\nLeave unknown users unexpanded when the system account lookup fails. This\r\nremoves the Unix shell fallback; valid users still expand through the account\r\ndatabase.\r\n\r\nAdds a functional test for the fast-event case.\r\n",
    "closed_at": "2026-07-17T18:21:30Z",
